<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/> </div> </div> <div n="2"> <head> <hi rendition="#fr #g">Eilftes Kapitel</hi>.<lb/>
</head> <milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/> <p>Ein pra&#x0364;chtiges Schloß u&#x0364;ber &#x017F;chimmernden Fernen,<lb/>
